# PHASE ORCHESTRATION V2.1 (RGV MULTI-PASS)

> **Purpose:** 5-phase workflow with RGV multi-pass iteration on Phase 3 & 4
> **Key Principle:** Update the OUTPUT DOCUMENT directly at each phase/pass (not a state file)

---

## PROGRESSIVE DOCUMENT APPROACH

**The output document is built progressively:**

```
Phase 1: CREATE document skeleton with placeholders
Phase 2: UPDATE document with requirements (or skip note)
Phase 3: RGV LOOP — UPDATE document with findings (Pass 1 replaces placeholders, Pass 2+ appends)
Phase 4: RGV LOOP — UPDATE document with mapping verification (Pass 1 replaces, Pass 2+ appends)
Phase 5: UPDATE document with RGV summary, score, and production decision
```

**Use `search_replace` after each phase/pass to update sections.**

---

