## DOCUMENT UPDATE PATTERN

**Use `search_replace` to update sections progressively:**

```
Phase 1:        write(skeleton)
Phase 2:        search_replace("_Pending Phase 2..._", actual_requirements)
Phase 3 Pass 1: search_replace("_Pending Phase 3 analysis..._", findings_pass_1)
Phase 3 Pass 2+: append(new_findings_pass_N) to existing tables
Phase 4 Pass 1: search_replace("_Pending Phase 4 analysis..._", mappings_pass_1)
Phase 4 Pass 2+: append(new_mapping_findings_pass_N) to existing table
Phase 5:        search_replace("_Pending RGV completion..._", convergence_summary)
                search_replace("_Pending Phase 5..._", actual_score)
                search_replace("_Pending_", actual_values)
                validate_no_placeholders_remain()
```

**Benefits:**
- Document is always viewable
- Progress is visible at any pass
- Delta tracking shows what each pass found
- No separate state file needed
- Easy to resume (just look at document + pass tags)

---

## ERROR RECOVERY

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| Phase fails | Document shows last completed phase, resume from there |
| User disconnects | Document preserved, continue where placeholders remain |
| Restart needed | Delete document, start fresh |

---

## PHASE TRANSITIONS

| From | To | Condition |
|------|-----|----------|
| 1 | 2 | User confirms scope |
| 2 | 3.1 | Requirements extracted (or skipped) |
| 3.N | 3.N+1 | Not converged + user approves | 
| 3.N | 4.1 | Converged OR user accepts findings |
| 4.N | 4.N+1 | Not converged + user approves |
| 4.N | 5 | Converged OR user accepts mappings |
| 5 | Done | Report finalized |

**Rule:** NEVER advance without user confirmation (except Phase 5 finalization). STOP between every RGV pass.

